<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst Sherman Chao said he downgraded Georgia-Pacific Corp to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate, citing concerns over market pulp pricing.</p>
<p>-- maintained long-term buy rating on stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 2-4/16 to 87-15/16.</p>
</text>
